    goingDeeper: "Creating new elements dynamically uses `document.createElement(\"div\")` followed by `.appendChild()` (or the newer `.append()`) to insert them into the page - genuinely useful for building UI pieces (like a new list item) entirely through JavaScript rather than only modifying elements that already existed in the original HTML.",
