    commonMistakes: ["Being able to state the ownership rules but not walk through a concrete move-semantics example live when asked - a very common interview gap between memorized definitions and actual understanding", "Explaining a Rust safety feature without naming the SPECIFIC bug class it prevents, missing the chance to demonstrate genuine understanding of Rust's actual motivation"],
