    goingDeeper: "C# 11 introduced RAW STRING LITERALS (`\"\"\"...\"\"\"`, similar to Kotlin's triple-quoted strings) for embedding multi-line text or content with many quotes/backslashes (like JSON or regex patterns) without needing escape characters - directly useful alongside string interpolation for building larger, more complex formatted output cleanly.",
